to 4 friends in local co-op mode! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374350/extras/410b42fed8562ff2ff531916731ebd3c.poster.avif?t=1781101606\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374350/extras/410b42fed8562ff2ff531916731ebd3c.webm?t=1781101606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374350/extras/410b42fed8562ff2ff531916731ebd3c.mp4?t=1781101606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374350/extras/8ee815e00de2f4a0526964d130086223.avif?t=1781101606\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up with a lethal arsenal of weaponry including rifles, rocket launchers, flamethrowers and assault shotguns, or get to the chopper and mount up on heavy machine guns to lay waste to your enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374350/extras/e65ef490ac27cf191527ba49727cc4e7.poster.avif?t=1781101606\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374350/extras/e65ef490ac27cf191527ba49727cc4e7.webm?t=1781101606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374350/extras/e65ef490ac27cf191527ba49727cc4e7.mp4?t=1781101606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\